model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway.accountRuntime {
    metadata {
      constraint "Account health and identity lists deduplicate identities and bind PostgreSQL text ID sets as one parameter; MySQL keeps native parameter comparisons for column collation and lossless values. Batched metadata preserves request-local owner and placement checks without caching authorization. The lifecycle placement import composes after earlier automatic-check imports without a start-of-file anchor. Server reads remain reactive and initial reads start before reconciliation; only observed failures or prolonged pending health back off. Mounted account reads share a bounded cadence that backs off unavailable or prolonged pending health."
    }
  }
}
